Z||000013||84Bill||05-14-2001||09:57 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChadMan:<BR><B>Looks like you've got your work cut out for you, Bill.  But I'm sure it will be suh-weet when you're done.<P>What's up with that remote oil filter?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah I figure a year or two of resto it's gonna be beautiful when I'm done. <BR>The remote filter came with the car, I asked the previous owner if he installed it and he said he didn't do it. Interesting isn't it. As easy as it makes filter changes it must go.<BR>||||reg||1
